---
---

<section class="section" id="self-host">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">Self-hosting</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Runs fully serverless on AWS.<br />One command to deploy.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Two Go Lambdas, DynamoDB, SQS, CloudFront. No servers to maintain, no containers to babysit.
      Clone the repo, fill in <code>.env</code>, run <code>just deploy</code>.
    </p>

    <div class="selfhost-grid">
      <div class="sh-panel">
        <p class="sh-panel-label">deploy</p>
        <div class="sh-code">
          <div class="code-line"><span class="cm"># one-time setup</span></div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="cli-prompt">$</span> <span class="cmd">cp .env.example .env <span class="cm">&amp;&amp; vim .env</span></span></div>
          <div class="code-line">&nbsp;</div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="cm"># deploy everything to AWS</span></div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="cli-prompt">$</span> <span class="cmd">just deploy</span></div>
          <div class="code-line">&nbsp;</div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="out">  ✓ S3 bucket</span></div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="out">  ✓ ACM certificate</span></div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="out">  ✓ Lambda (api + processor)</span></div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="out">  ✓ DynamoDB + SQS</span></div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="out">  ✓ CloudFront distribution</span></div>
          <div class="code-line">&nbsp;</div>
          <div class="code-line"><span class="cm"># add DNS CNAME and you're live</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sh-steps">
        <div class="sh-step">
          <div class="sh-step-num">1</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Prerequisites</h4>
            <p>AWS CLI configured, <a href="https://just.systems/man/en/">Just</a> command runner, <a href="https://mailjet.com/">Mailjet</a> account for email delivery (optional). That's it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sh-step">
          <div class="sh-step-num">2</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Configure <code>.env</code></h4>
            <p>Set your domain, Auth0 credentials, Mailjet API keys, and e-reader device send-to email. CloudFormation handles the rest.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sh-step">
          <div class="sh-step-num">3</div>
          <div>
            <h4><code>just deploy</code></h4>
            <p>Builds both Go Lambdas for Linux, uploads zips to S3, deploys the CloudFormation stack, provisions CloudFront. Add a DNS CNAME to your domain and you're done.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sh-infra-tags">
          <span class="infra-tag">Lambda</span>
          <span class="infra-tag">DynamoDB</span>
          <span class="infra-tag">SQS</span>
          <span class="infra-tag">CloudFront</span>
          <span class="infra-tag">ACM</span>
          <span class="infra-tag">Auth0</span>
          <span class="infra-tag">Mailjet</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://github.com/savetoink/savetoink#self-hosting" class="btn-secondary sh-docs-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Read the self-hosting docs →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .selfhost-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .sh-panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sh-panel-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 6%, var(--paper));
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sh-code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 3%, var(--paper));
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .code-line {
    display: block;
  }

  .cli-prompt {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    user-select: none;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cmd  { color: var(--ink); }
  .cm   { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }
  .out  { color: #22c55e; padding-left: 0.25rem; }

  /* Steps */
  .sh-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sh-step {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .sh-step-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .sh-step h4 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .sh-step p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .sh-step code, p code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 6%, var(--paper));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem;
  }

  .sh-infra-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .infra-tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
  }

  .sh-docs-link {
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .selfhost-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
